    "NOTE": "RAD_RDR_2012_221_02_47_0002_V00.TXT contains one sol's worth of all observations taken from the Mars Science Laboratory Radiation Assessment Detector (RAD) for the mission elapsed sol 2. This file is in human readable ASCII form and the data have undergone calibration and decompression from the binary MSL RAD EDR data.",
    "DESCRIPTION": "This file contains data from RAD_RDR: Radiation Assessment Detector on the Mars Science Laboratory (MSL). There is one sol's worth of observations where each observation can have four types of data: (1) Counters, (2) Histograms, (3) Dosimetry, and (4) PHA data. These data are organized in a hierarchical fashion in which some observations may not have all four types. These are described in the data object sections. For additional information and details concerning data organization, science meaning, etc., please refer to the Data Set Catalog, MSLRAD_RDR_DS.CAT."
